None that I know of. Lemme write up a rudimentary lsit, using data from 
http://nethack.wikia.com:

* Force bolt (1): 2d12; may destroy fragile objects
* Drain life (2): 1d8; drains one level
  * No effect on drain-resistant monsters
* Magic missile (2): (XL/2+1)d6
  * Can be reflected
* Cone of cold (4): 6d6 cold; may destroy potions
  * Can be reflected at unskilled or basic
* Fireball (4): 6d6 fire; may destroy potions/scrolls/spellbooks
  * Can damage flammable armor
  * Can be reflected at unskilled and basic
* Finger of death (7): Instant death; golems, undead, and demons resist
  * WARNING: WILL KILL YOU IF YOU ZAP IT AT YOURSELF.
    * YES, EVEN IF YOU HAVE REFLECTION/MAGIC RESISTANCE.


